        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Upma serves 4 and takes about 30 minutes. Toast the "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "semolina",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "fine-semolina"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " first so the upma is fluffy, not pasty. Add the hot water carefully, as it will steam."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Toast the semolina until it smells nutty before adding any liquid."
          }
        ]
      },
