      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Upma is a quick South Indian breakfast. It turns semolina into a savoury, filling meal. Vegetables and cashews make it hearty. Serve it with a wedge of lime or chutney. It is ready in the time it takes to make tea."
          }
        ]
      }
